   "text": "RELATIONS\n\nblue        children\n               framework \u2192 category\n               \u2192 term \u2192 child term\n\nred          associatedTo\n               role term \u2192 leaf skill\n               the only relation that\n               crosses a category\n\ngreen      skills tag on content\n\ndashed    LP.targetRole",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "RELATIONS\n\nblue        children\n               framework \u2192 category\n               \u2192 term \u2192 child term\n\nred          associatedTo\n               role term \u2192 leaf skill\n               the only relation that\n               crosses a category\n\ngreen      skills tag on content\n\ndashed    LP.targetRole",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e0048",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 790,
   "width": 1120,
   "height": 30,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#5f6368",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 48,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No proficiency levels.  No requirement terms.  A role names the leaf skills it needs, and content is tagged with the same leaves.\nDepth is a minimum of three tiers and has no upper bound; the tier names are display labels on the framework, not categories.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "No proficiency levels.  No requirement terms.  A role names the leaf skills it needs, and content is tagged with the same leaves.\nDepth is a minimum of three tiers and has no upper bound; the tier names are display labels on the framework, not categories.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
